<title>SWITZERLAND: Sudelektra expects to profit from rise.</title>
<headline>Sudelektra expects to profit from rise.</headline>
<dateline>ZUG, Switzerland 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sudelektra Holding AG said it expected to profit from rising prices on raw materials markets after acquisitions and investments last year expanded capacity.  </p>
<p>&quot;Through investments of $82.4 million and acquisitions for $90.0 million in the past year which will bring a rise in production capacity and an expansion of business, Suedelektra will increasingly profit from the rise on raw materials markets,&quot; it said in a statement.</p>
<p>Suedelektra said it would maintain its growth-oriented strategy as a diversified raw materials group involved in areas with sustainably low production costs.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
